     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m sure this must be a misunderstanding on my part, but I can&#39;t get a plot to appear in a tabPanel.  Code is below.</div><div><br></div><div>Print out of &#39;tst1&#39; and &#39;tst2&#39; show that space is being allocated on the page for the plot, but it doesn&#39;t appear.</div><div><br></div><div>If, instead of tabsetPanel(…) I put plotOutput(&quot;basePlot&quot;), the plot appears just fine.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for any help!</div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">library(shiny)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">require(shiny);</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">shinyUI= pageWithSidebar(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  headerPanel(&quot;Header&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  sidebarPanel(&quot;Sidebar&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  mainPanel(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">     #       plotOutput(&quot;basePlot&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">     tabsetPanel(id=&quot;myTabset&quot;,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">     tabPanel(&quot;plot1&quot;, &#39;tst1&#39;,plotOutput(&quot;basePlot&quot;),&#39;tst2&#39;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">     tabPanel(&quot;plot2&quot;, plotOutput(&quot;basePlot&quot;))</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">shinyServer = function(input,output){</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    output$basePlot = renderPlot(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">        plot(rnorm(100),rnorm(100))</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">}</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">runApp(list(ui=shinyUI,server=shinyServer))</font></div><div><br></div></div>"
